		"&7&#66CCFFBrain Heart Cabbage&7 can be used as a substitute for &#66FF66Cabbage&7 / &#66FF66Cabbage Leaves&7 in some recipes."
		"&mIs this cabbage even legit?&r"
	]
	quest.0167D4BEB8E8FB00.quest_subtitle: "As the saying goes, eat what you lack"
	quest.017488D14BA19FAA.quest_desc: [
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"This modpack supports searching for material traits and part types in \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"EMI\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\":\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]}"
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"• Enter \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"%trait_name\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" (e.g. \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"%toughness\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\") to find all materials with that trait\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]}"
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"• Enter \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"&part_type\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" (e.g. \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"&main\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" or \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"&main_part\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\") to find materials usable for that part type\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]}"
		""
		""
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Most materials in this modpack have stage level indicators. You can search \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"\"Stage X\"\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" in \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"EMI\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" to view materials for \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"X\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\" stage.\",\"color\":\"gray\"}]}"
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"The stage is mostly determined by the material's era, \",\"color\":\"gray\"},{\"text\":\"but that doesn't mean you can only obtain next-stage items after reaching stage X.\",\"color\":\"red\"}]}"
		""
		"{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"We know the guidance is lacking... but we're bad at writing quests—we're trying our best, misery.\"}]}"
	]
	quest.017488D14BA19FAA.quest_subtitle: "The modpack includes many optimizations and tweaks for Silent Gear"
	quest.017488D14BA19FAA.title: "Make Good Use of EMI"
	quest.017E000317AA737C.quest_desc: ["&7Right-click to summon a flying sword with &#66CCFFindependent invincibility frames&7. Damage depends on the sword's stats when summoned (re-summon if stats change)."]
	quest.017E000317AA737C.quest_subtitle: "Sword, Come Forth!"
	quest.017E000317AA737C.title: "Flying Sword"
	quest.01891B78BD11035B.quest_subtitle: "Choose One"
	quest.01891B78BD11035B.title: "&a\"Honey That Conceals Suffering at the Beginning?!\""
	quest.01DFC41A894B42AC.quest_desc: ["&7Can be used for &#66CCFFfishing&7. &#FFD700Luck&7 reduces the time it takes to catch a fish."]
	quest.01DFC41A894B42AC.quest_subtitle: "What're you looking at? Never seen someone come back empty-handed?"
	quest.01FCAFCAA454BC91.quest_desc: [
		"&7Candles have long been associated with the occult. In Apotheosis enchanting, candles provide 1.25% &5Arcana&7. While small, multiple candles together provide more &5Arcana&7 power."
		""
		"&7Candles found early on can be used to gather some Arcana. They can be retired once advanced bookshelves are crafted."
	]
	quest.01FCAFCAA454BC91.quest_subtitle: "Minor Arcana Growth"
	quest.01FCAFCAA454BC91.title: "Primitive Occultism"
	quest.0218EB7431BC6CBD.title: "Zombie Giant Rat"
	quest.023E0809115DF9D3.quest_desc: ["&7Eliminates wind effects and adds a cockpit instrument panel. Enhances immersion (?) and increases flight stability, which can help prevent unintended flips."]
	quest.02754C209AD4C9F5.quest_desc: ["&7I began trying to infuse essence energy into various objects—but clearly, not every infusion yields results. There is compatibility between essences and materials; only sufficiently compatible recipes can exist stably."]
	quest.02754C209AD4C9F5.title: "Material Research"
	quest.02AFD33E635B23E1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pact of the Shattering Addict"
		"&7The side effects of the curse are not to be underestimated.&r&cEach day without harvesting essence causes withdrawal to stack, continuously consuming more hunger until the craving is satisfied."
		"&7A curse forced upon the mind—an unending hunger for arcane energy.&r&aShattering souls yields extra arcane energy&r&aConsecutive shattering yields even more"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/malum/pact_of_the_shattering_addict.png width:160 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.02AFD33E635B23E1.quest_subtitle: "Shatter and Shatter Again"
	quest.02AFD33E635B23E1.title: "Pact of the Shattering Addict"
	quest.02BFE6EA90831AED.quest_desc: [
		"&6Oath of the Overburdened Mind&r"
		""
		"&7The knowledge you have acquired demands careful consideration.&r"
		"&7-&cSpell&r&7 charge time increased by one quarter&r"
		""
		"&7A vessel for arcane knowledge melded into consciousness.&r"
		"&7-&aSpell ammo capacity&r&7 doubled&r"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/gui/malum/oath_of_the_overburdened_mind.png width:160 height:200 align:center}"
